<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<title>Cornerstone &mdash; Logo &amp; Brand Pack</title>
<meta name="description" content="Logo files, colours and fonts for Cornerstone Claims Adjusters." />
<link rel="icon" href="files/png/cornerstone-mark-32.png" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#D91A3B;--red-dk:#A8142E;--ink:#242323;--grey:#5A5755;--grey2:#8C8784;
 --paper:#F4F2EF;--card:#fff;--line:rgba(36,35,35,.14);
 --disp:'Archivo',sans-serif;--body:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0}
p{margin:0 0 1em}
a{color:var(--red-dk)}
.wrap{width:min(100% - 40px,1140px);margin-inline:auto}
.top{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.top__in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.top img{height:44px;width:auto}
.top span{font-size:13px;color:var(--grey2)}
.hero{background:#fff;padding:clamp(32px,6vw,64px) 0 clamp(28px,5vw,52px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.kick{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.19em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);margin:0 0 14px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);max-width:18ch}
.hero .lede{font-size:clamp(16.5px,1.5vw,19.5px);color:var(--grey);max-width:62ch;margin-top:16px}
.zip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;
 font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:17px 26px;border-radius:3px;margin-top:26px}
.zip:hover{background:#000}
.zip small{font-weight:400;opacity:.65;letter-spacing:0}
section.blk{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,74px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.bh{max-width:70ch;margin-bottom:clamp(22px,3vw,36px)}
.bh h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px)}
.bh p{color:var(--grey);margin:10px 0 0}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14.5px;vertical-align:top}
th{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--grey2);background:var(--paper)}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
td a{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:600;word-break:break-all}
.gh{margin:clamp(20px,3vw,34px) 0 14px;padding-top:18px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}
.gh h3{font-size:19px}
.gh p{color:var(--grey);margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14.5px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:16px}
.as{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.pv{border-radius:4px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:118px;overflow:hidden}
.pv--light{background:var(--paper)}
.pv--dark{background:var(--ink)}
.pv--none{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#f2f0ed,#f2f0ed 8px,#eae7e3 8px,#eae7e3 16px);
 font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey2);text-align:center;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:600}
.pv img{max-height:92px;width:auto}
.as h4{font-size:15px;margin:14px 0 10px}
.dl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:auto}
.dl a{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:5px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:11px;
 letter-spacing:.05em;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
 padding:7px 10px;border-radius:3px}
.dl a:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red-dk)}
.dl a span{font-weight:400;font-size:10px;color:var(--grey2)}
.sws{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px}
.sw{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:14px}
.sw span{display:block;height:56px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:10px}
.sw b{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:14.5px;display:block}
.sw code{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey2);display:block;margin:2px 0 6px}
.sw small{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey);line-height:1.45;display:block}
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,34px)}
@media(max-width:800px){.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:clamp(18px,2.5vw,26px)}
.panel h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:10px}
.panel ul{margin:0;padding-left:19px;color:var(--grey);font-size:14.5px}
.panel li{margin-bottom:8px}
.panel li b{color:var(--ink)}
.spec{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:6px}
.spec--b{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:15.5px;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--grey);line-height:1.6}
.rules{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:clamp(18px,2.5vw,26px)}
.rules h3{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:12px}
.do{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
@media(max-width:700px){.do{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.do h4{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}
.do--y h4{color:#17653A}.do--n h4{color:#A1122B}
.do ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--grey)}
.do li{margin-bottom:6px}
.foot{padding:34px 0 66px;color:var(--grey);font-size:14.5px}
.foot a{color:var(--ink)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top"><div class="wrap top__in">
  <img src="files/png/cornerstone-logo-horizontal-1200.png" alt="Cornerstone Claims Adjusters" />
  <span>Prepared by Williams Digital &middot; September 2026</span>
</div></header>

<div class="hero"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kick">Logo &amp; brand pack</p>
  <h1>Your new logo, ready to use anywhere.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every version of the logo, in every format you are likely to be asked for, plus your
  colours and both fonts. Download the lot, or pick individual files below. If someone asks you for
  &ldquo;the vector,&rdquo; send them the SVG or the PDF.</p>
  <a class="zip" href="files/cornerstone-brand-pack.zip" download>Download everything <small>ZIP &middot; %%ZIPSIZE%%</small></a>
</div></div>

<main>
<section class="blk"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="bh"><h2>Which file do I use?</h2>
  <p>The short answer for the things you will actually do.</p></div>
  <table><thead><tr><th>When you are doing this</th><th>Use this file</th><th>Format</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>%%USE%%</tbody></table>
</div></section>

<section class="blk"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="bh"><h2>All the files</h2>
  <p>Dark versions are for white and light backgrounds. The &ldquo;reversed&rdquo; versions are for charcoal,
  photographs and dark colours. One-colour versions are for engraving, stamps and single-colour printing.</p></div>
  %%GROUPS%%
</div></section>

<section class="blk"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="bh"><h2>Your colours</h2>
  <p>Give these codes to anyone printing or building something for you.</p></div>
  <div class="sws">%%COLORS%%</div>
</div></section>

<section class="blk"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="bh"><h2>Your fonts</h2>
  <p>Both are free for business use, including on vehicles, signage and printed reports. They are in the
  download, in the <code>fonts</code> folder.</p></div>
  <div class="cols">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="spec">Archivo</div>
      <p style="color:var(--grey);font-size:14.5px;margin:0 0 12px">Headings, the logo, buttons and figures.</p>
      <ul><li><b>Install it:</b> double-click <code>Archivo-Variable.ttf</code> and choose Install. On Windows,
      right-click and choose &ldquo;Install for all users.&rdquo;</li>
      <li><b>If you cannot install fonts</b> on a machine, use <b>Arial Bold</b> in its place.</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="spec spec--b" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)">Inter</div>
      <p style="color:var(--grey);font-size:14.5px;margin:0 0 12px">Body text, letters, reports and email.</p>
      <ul><li><b>Install it:</b> same as above, using <code>Inter-Variable.ttf</code>.</li>
      <li><b>If you cannot install fonts,</b> use <b>Arial</b> or <b>Calibri</b> in its place.</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="blk"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="bh"><h2>A few rules</h2>
  <p>Nothing fussy &mdash; these just keep the logo looking like itself.</p></div>
  <div class="rules"><div class="do">
    <div class="do--y"><h4>Please do</h4><ul>
      <li>Leave clear space around the logo, at least the height of the red square, on every side.</li>
      <li>Use the reversed version on dark backgrounds and photographs.</li>
      <li>Send the SVG or PDF to sign makers, embroiderers and printers.</li>
      <li>Use the mark on its own when the space is square or very small.</li>
    </ul></div>
    <div class="do--n"><h4>Please don't</h4><ul>
      <li>Stretch, squash or rotate it.</li>
      <li>Change the colours, or add shadows, glows or outlines.</li>
      <li>Put the dark logo on a dark background, or the reversed one on white.</li>
      <li>Rebuild it in Word or Canva, or scale a small PNG up &mdash; it will go blurry.</li>
      <li>Use the horizontal logo smaller than about 24px tall on screen, or 0.3 inch in print.</li>
    </ul></div>
  </div></div>
</div></section>
</main>

<footer class="foot"><div class="wrap">
  <p><b>Anything missing, or need a size that is not here?</b> Ask and I will make it &mdash; there is no charge for
  additional sizes or formats of this logo.</p>
  <p><a href="mailto:Dylan@williamsdigital.io">Dylan@williamsdigital.io</a> &middot; <a href="tel:+12057891211">(205) 789-1211</a></p>
  <p style="color:var(--grey2);font-size:13px;margin-top:18px">The logo artwork belongs to Cornerstone Claims Adjusters, LLC.
  A trademark search was not part of this work; if you ever want to register the mark, a trademark attorney should check it first.</p>
</div></footer>
</body>
</html>
